  "title": "Infinity Natural Resources Announces First Quarter 2026 Results Earnings Release and Conference Call Dates",
  "summary": "Infinity Natural Resources, Inc. (“Infinity” or the “Company”) (NYSE: INR) announced today that it will report first quarter 2026 financial and operating results after the market close on Tuesday, May 12, 2026. Management will host a conference call the following day, Wednesday, May 13, 2026, at 10:00 a.m. ET to discuss the results. To participate in the call, register at https://events.q4inc.com/analyst/805823647?pwd=C2fZN5eO or dial +1 585 542 9983 (U.S. Local) or +1 833 461 5787 (U.S. Toll-Fr",
